{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-video-playlist",
  "category": "media",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-video-playlist&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "styles": ".cluster { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: center; }",
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-video-playlist",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Reproductor de playlist con look YouTube: cabecera con título y canal,",
        "          barra inferior overlay con play / seek / vol, lista colapsable debajo.",
        "          Las herramientas adicionales (prev / next / autoplay) se proyectan",
        "          automáticamente en los slots <code class=\"code\">tools-left</code>",
        "          y <code class=\"code\">tools-right</code> del reproductor."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-video-playlist id=\"pl\" autoplay-next placement=\"bottom\">",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Big Buck Bunny\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Sintel\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Elephants Dream\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/03-elephants-dream.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/03-elephants-dream.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "          </iswc-video-playlist>"
          ],
          "controls": [
            {
              "control": "boolean",
              "prop": "attr:autoplay-next",
              "label": "autoplay-next"
            },
            {
              "control": "select",
              "prop": "attr:placement",
              "label": "placement",
              "options": [
                "left",
                "right",
                "bottom"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "placement",
      "title": "Placement",
      "lede": [
        "<code class=\"code\">placement</code>:",
        "          <code class=\"code\">left</code> |",
        "          <code class=\"code\">right</code> |",
        "          <code class=\"code\">bottom</code> (default)."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"cluster\" style=\"margin-bottom:0.75rem;flex-shrink:0\">",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"placeLeft\" variant=\"outlined\">left</iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"placeRight\" variant=\"outlined\">right</iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-button id=\"placeBottom\" variant=\"filled\">bottom</iswc-button>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <iswc-video-playlist id=\"plPlace\" placement=\"bottom\">",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Big Buck Bunny\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Sintel\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "          </iswc-video-playlist>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "tools",
      "title": "Herramientas",
      "lede": [
        "El reproductor expone dos slots: <code class=\"code\">tools-left</code>",
        "          (a la izquierda del play) y <code class=\"code\">tools-right</code>",
        "          (a la derecha del volumen). El playlist inyecta por defecto",
        "          <em>Primero / Anterior / Siguiente</em> en <code class=\"code\">tools-left</code>",
        "          y <em>Autoplay</em> en <code class=\"code\">tools-right</code>. Si quieres",
        "          reemplazarlos, basta con añadir tus propios botones con esos slots",
        "          desde fuera (o usa el atributo <code class=\"code\">no-default-tools</code>",
        "          para desactivarlos)."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-video-playlist id=\"plTools\" placement=\"bottom\">",
            "            <button slot=\"tools-left\" class=\"vp-tool vp-custom\" aria-label=\"Aleatorio\">",
            "              <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:shuffle\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            </button>",
            "            <button slot=\"tools-left\" class=\"vp-tool vp-custom\" aria-label=\"Bucle\">",
            "              <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:repeat\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            </button>",
            "            <button slot=\"tools-right\" class=\"vp-tool vp-custom\" aria-label=\"Subtítulos\">",
            "              <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:closed-caption\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            </button>",
            "            <button slot=\"tools-right\" class=\"vp-tool vp-custom\" aria-label=\"Pantalla completa\">",
            "              <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:fullscreen\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            </button>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Big Buck Bunny\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Sintel\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "          </iswc-video-playlist>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "channel",
      "title": "Título y canal",
      "lede": [
        "El playlist muestra automáticamente el título del clip activo en la",
        "          cabecera y, si está disponible, el canal como caption. También puedes",
        "          forzar el canal de toda la playlist con el atributo",
        "          <code class=\"code\">channel</code>."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-video-playlist id=\"plChannel\" placement=\"bottom\" channel=\"InSoft TV\">",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Big Buck Bunny\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Sintel\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "          </iswc-video-playlist>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "config",
      "title": "Configuración",
      "titleHtml": false,
      "lede": [
        "La esquina superior derecha de la cabecera acepta un slot",
        "          <code class=\"code\">config</code> para colgar un botón / menú opcional.",
        "          Si no se usa, esa zona queda vacía."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-video-playlist id=\"plConfig\" placement=\"bottom\">",
            "            <iswc-button slot=\"config\" variant=\"plain\" aria-label=\"Ajustes\">",
            "              <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:cog\"></iswc-icon>",
            "            </iswc-button>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Big Buck Bunny\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Sintel\"",
            "              channel=\"Blender Open Movies\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "          </iswc-video-playlist>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "events",
      "title": "Eventos",
      "lede": "Sin cambios aún.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-video-playlist id=\"eventPl\" placement=\"right\" style=\"max-height:22rem\">",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Alpha\"",
            "              channel=\"Canal A\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "            <iswc-video",
            "              title=\"Beta\"",
            "              channel=\"Canal B\"",
            "              poster=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.jpg\"",
            "              playsinline",
            "              src=\"{assets}playlist/02-sintel.mp4\"",
            "            ></iswc-video>",
            "          </iswc-video-playlist>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "API",
            "Detalle"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>placement</code>",
              "<code>left</code> | <code>right</code> | <code>bottom</code> (default); <code>top</code> queda como <code>bottom</code>."
            ],
            [
              "<code>autoplay-next</code>",
              "boolean — al terminar, reproduce el siguiente (en el último se detiene)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>accordion</code>",
              "<code>auto</code> (default) | <code>open</code> | <code>closed</code>"
            ],
            [
              "<code>channel</code>",
              "caption global (estilo canal YouTube) bajo el título del clip activo"
            ],
            [
              "<code>no-default-tools</code>",
              "desactiva los botones prev / next / autoplay por defecto"
            ],
            [
              "<code>goTo(i)</code> <code>next()</code> <code>previous()</code>",
              "navegación (también botones en el player)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>iswc-video-change</code>",
              "<code>{ previousIndex, currentIndex, video }</code>"
            ],
            [
              "slots",
              "<code>tools-left</code>, <code>tools-right</code> (botones en la barra del reproductor) · <code>config</code> (esquina sup. derecha de la cabecera)"
            ],
            [
              "parts",
              "<code>video-playlist</code> <code>header</code> <code>title</code> <code>channel</code> <code>player-toolbar</code> <code>tools-left</code> <code>tools-right</code> <code>playlist</code> <code>playlist-item</code> <code>playlist-thumbnail</code>"
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
